    excerpt: "Comprehensive legal and cryptographic analysis of electronic document admissibility under Section 65B of the Indian Evidence Act (now Section 63 of Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam 2023). Why unverified PDF signatures fail in court and how to establish long-term validation (LTV).",
