    id: "c82b1234-5567-4fa3-9921-salary-slip-guide-2026",
    title: "Salary Slip Calculation & Format FY 2025–26: New Tax Regime, Standard Deduction & PF Rules",
    slug: "salary-slip-calculation-format-fy-2025-26-new-tax-regime-guide",
    excerpt: "Comprehensive guide to salary slip calculation for FY 2025–26 under the default New Tax Regime. Detailed breakdown of ₹75,000 standard deduction, HRA, EPF 12% calculation, Professional Tax, and in-hand take-home salary formula.",
